# Automate Your Business With AI Agents

A framework for building reliable agentic automation with git, simple code and cloud infrastructure, turning unpredictable AI into dependable automation.

## Overview

AI can write code, but production automation still needs structure. This framework pairs an orchestrator with single-purpose agents, typed contracts, and git-based deployment on Code Capsules. This series covers why brittle workflows fail, how an orchestrator drives ephemeral agent capsules, how to design agent boundaries, and how to deploy through git.

